---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { APP_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Support"
  description={`Get help with ${APP_NAME}. Contact us by email for support, feedback, and questions.`}
>
  <main class="support">
    <a class="back" href="/">← Back to {APP_NAME}</a>

    <h1>{APP_NAME} Support</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Need help with {APP_NAME}? We are happy to help with gameplay questions,
      technical issues, feedback, or App Store requests.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Email us</h2>
      <p>
        The fastest way to reach us is email. Include your device model, iOS
        version, and a short description of the issue when you can.
      </p>
      <p class="email-line">
        <a class="email" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>How do I play?</strong> Watch the meter fill, then tap to stop
          it inside the zone. Perfect and Great hits build your combo; miss and
          you lose a heart.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Does the game need an account?</strong> No. There is no sign-in
          and progress is stored on your device.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Can I turn off sound or haptics?</strong> Yes — both can be
          disabled in the in-app settings.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Where is my data?</strong> High scores, settings, and unlocks
          stay on your device. See our
          <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Response time</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to reply within a few business days. For urgent App Store review
        or account issues, mention that in the subject line.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .support {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .back:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    color: var(--panel-ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  p,
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--panel-ink);
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  li + li {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  .email-line {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .email {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
